iption>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133040886.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In today's fast-paced world, the age-old human inclination to dodge self-reflection has intensified. Individuals often turn to myriad distractions to avoid confronting uncomfortable thoughts and feelings. This constant quest for entertainment can lead to poor decision-making and decreased well-being. Modern psychological approaches emphasize the importance of fostering moments of stillness and reflection, as understanding this behavior is essential in facing both personal and societal hurdles.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-blaise-pascal-all-of-humanitys-problems-stem-from-mans-inability-to-sit-quietly-in-a-room-alone-and-the-100-billion-industry-built-to-keep-you-from-doing-it/articleshow/133040886.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-blaise-pascal-all-of-humanitys-problems-stem-from-mans-inability-to-sit-quietly-in-a-room-alone-and-the-100-billion-industry-built-to-keep-you-from-doing-it/articleshow/133040886.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T00:25:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133041285,imgsize-942882.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Who introduced them?' US senator says it's odd to see Justin Trudeau frolicking around Katy Perry; 'He used to be in charge of a whole country']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133040896.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-introduced-them-us-senator-says-its-odd-to-see-justin-trudeau-frolicking-around-katy-perry-he-used-to-be-in-charge-of-a-whole-country/articleshow/133040896.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-introduced-them-us-senator-says-its-odd-to-see-justin-trudeau-frolicking-around-katy-perry-he-used-to-be-in-charge-of-a-whole-country/articleshow/133040896.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T00:12:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133040941,imgsize-394668.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California lost as many as 1.3 million Joshua trees in the 2020 Dome Fire]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133039377.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[California scientists developed digital tools to map fire damage in the Mojave National Preserve.  These new software programs help park managers focus restoration work on vulnerable desert plants.  The tools assist in assessing post-fire conditions and developing recovery plans for affected areas.  Scenario modeling directs limited conservation resources to high-elevation climate refugia for Joshua trees.  This technology aims to improve the chances of survival for these iconic desert plants.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-lost-as-many-as-1-3-million-joshua-trees-in-the-2020-dome-fire-new-software-now-helps-park-managers-target-recovery-after-wildfires/articleshow/133039377.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-lost-as-many-as-1-3-million-joshua-trees-in-the-2020-dome-fire-new-software-now-helps-park-managers-target-recovery-after-wildfires/articleshow/133039377.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-07T23:59:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/p